[{"title":"新居用韩昌黎诗辛勤三十年以有此屋庐为韵作十诗 其十","author":"蔡戡","text":"平生湖海气，志广更才疏。\n致君初无术，许身一何愚。\n慨念天下士，四海无家居。\n但愿庇广厦，不唯爱吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28429,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新居用韩昌黎诗辛勤三十年以有此屋庐为韵作十诗 其七","author":"蔡戡","text":"庭前植三桂，门外栽五柳。\n有禽号仙客，爱莲呼静友。\n邻墙竹千挺，晚色落杯酒。\n终日对此君，乌知非我有。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28430,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题端约喜神诗","author":"蔡戡","text":"高楼结蜃桥垂虹，人间梦幻色即空。\n何劳愚智徒相攻，无异蛮触战蜗虫。\n先生学道尤温恭，皎然明月来窗栊。\n幅巾宛有林下风，身虽隐约声如镛。\n何人为写冰雪容，屹若山立凝神锋。\n长松诘曲盘虬龙，朱藤缓步行松中。\n治世乃有商山翁，青鞋不踏京尘红。\n宦游已悟禽入笼，谁能薄禄仰釜钟。\n百年驹隙成匆匆，一廛可老荆溪东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28431,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 其一 南徐秋阅宴诸将，代老人作","author":"蔡戡","text":"肃霜靡衰草，骤雨洗寒空。\n刀弓斗力增劲，万马骤西风。\n细看外围合阵，忽变横斜曲直，妙在指麾中。\n号令肃诸将，谈笑听元戎。\n坐中客，休笑我，已衰翁。\n十年重到，今日此会与谁同。\n差把龙钟鹤发，来对虎头燕颔，年少总英雄。\n飞镞落金碗，酣醉吸长虹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28432,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 其二 送赵帅镇成都","author":"蔡戡","text":"拥节出闽峤，易镇上岷山。\n东西崄岨，分陕初不在荣观。\n痛念两河未复，独作中流砥柱，屹若障狂澜。\n极目神京远，百万虎貔闲。\n趁良时，摅豹略，勇声欢。\n风飞雷厉，威行逆虏胆生寒。\n汉寝周原如旧，一扫腥膻丑类，谈笑定三关。\n认取投机会，莫作等闲看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28433,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"点绛唇 百索","author":"蔡戡","text":"纤手工夫，采丝五色交相映。\n同心端正。\n上有双鸳并。\n皓腕轻缠，结就相思病。\n凭谁信。\n玉肌宽尽。\n却系心儿紧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28434,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"蔡楙","text":"竹静深留月，花多不辨香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28435,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"蔡楙","text":"曙分林影外，春尽雨声中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28436,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤栖梧/蝶恋花 寄贺司户","author":"蔡楠","text":"狂滥生涯今几许。\n敕赐湖天，万顷烟波主。\n约我小舟同老去。\n要前一叶风掀舞。\n邂逅同寻溪上路。\n淡墨题诗，正在云深处。\n别后作书频寄语。\n无忘林下萧萧雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28437,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 寄仙岩辛承旨","author":"蔡楠","text":"碧梧转影，正露冷天高，凉生襟袖。\n此夕清辉，谁信道、夜色居然如昼。\n玉斧重修，宝奁初启，万里寒光透。\n将军高会，翠鬟争劝尊酒。\n遥想地近仙丘，碧山高处，引手攀星斗。\n醉嘱姮娥，惟但愿、月与佳人长久。\n罗覆银鞍，雨抛金甲，赢得诗千首。\n掀髯一笑，此怀人解知否。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28438,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阮郎归 其一 寄友","author":"蔡楠","text":"夕阳低户水当楼。\n风烟惨淡秋。\n乱云飞尽碧山留。\n寒沙卧海鸥。\n浑似画，只供愁。\n相看空泪流。\n故人如欲问安不。\n病来今白头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28439,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阮郎归 其二 和","author":"蔡楠","text":"栏干十二绕层楼。\n珠帘卷素秋。\n当年尊酒屡迟留。\n识公惟白鸥。\n才得趣，又成愁。\n情钟我辈流。\n买山同隐肯来不。\n遥怜笑点头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28440,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳 寓向仲德宿云轩几两月，归南丰、道中寄","author":"蔡楠","text":"手染橙芗，杯摇烛影，夜阑人意醺酣。\n故人惜别，却酒更清谈。\n只合相从老矣，知何事、还著征衫。\n流年晚，长途匹马，奔走亦何堪。\n江潭。\n摇落后，云嘘绝壁，雪舞空岩。\n念行人归鬓，今已毵毵。\n往事真成梦里，十年恨、江北江南。\n休凝伫，霜风卷地，寒日又西衔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28441,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"蔡楠","text":"病酒厌厌与睡宜。\n珠帘罗幕卷银泥。\n风来绿树花含笑，恨入西楼月敛眉。\n惊瘦尽，怨归迟。\n休将桐叶更题诗。\n不知桥下无情水，流到天涯是几时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28442,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅江晚泛二首 其二","author":"蔡蒙吉","text":"何处吹横笛，萧萧荻苇丛。\n徐看钓艇出，蓑笠一渔翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28443,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅江晚泛二首 其一","author":"蔡蒙吉","text":"罢读出江岸，江波滚滚来。\n呼舟閒打桨，载月二更回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28444,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游王寿山","author":"蔡蒙吉","text":"王寿山头石径斜，不知何处有仙家。\n烟霞踏遍芒鞋破，一路春鸠啼落花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28445,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阴那山","author":"蔡蒙吉","text":"宫阙空悬胜绝奇，天然泉石画中窥。\n五峰指月攒寒玉，二水流云漾碧漪。\n鱼鸟身如游极乐，猿猴心似发菩提。\n沈沈钟鼓僧閒寂，客亦忘言自得之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28446,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"蔡雍","text":"满前青嶂千屏列，直下澄江一带横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28447,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日僧舍偶成","author":"蔡槃","text":"落帽年年学孟嘉，今年偶客梵王家。\n石床斋散门初掩，细雨声中落菊花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28448,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫主祠","author":"蔡槃","text":"玉镜台前懒画眉，伤心最是月明时。\n君恩渐绝门深掩，落尽閒花竟不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28449,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人间","author":"蔡槃","text":"弃尽人间事，西风掩竹门。\n无人争碧嶂，有鹤伴黄昏。\n扫石移云影，浇花润月痕。\n何须叹牢落，知我有乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28450,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居","author":"蔡槃","text":"急雨开新霁，薰风献嫩凉。\n苔花停画壁，云叶护书床。\n枕上清风细，诗中雅兴长。\n地偏人到少，幽鸟语新篁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28451,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山城即事","author":"蔡槃","text":"独上山楼上，楼高望尽天。\n更无云一点，只有月孤圆。\n树老飘黄叶，湖空起白烟。\n故园音信断，愁绝不成眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28452,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬夕寄友","author":"蔡槃","text":"壁灯花落夜将残，天远那知客思单。\n鹤帐不成云外梦，燕楼空锁雨中寒。\n千年风雅教谁主，一曲凄凉只自弹。\n又恐孤山梅渐老，明朝相约过长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28453,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瓜州","author":"蔡槃","text":"烟际系孤舟，芦花两岸秋。\n江空双雁落，天迥一星流。\n急鼓西津渡，残云北固楼。\n商人茅店下，沽酒话扬州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28454,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次幽居","author":"蔡槃","text":"却粒烧丹未有方，且逃人事住山房。\n冷看桐叶含秋思，閒扫苔花背夕阳。\n墙壁遍题无酒句，衣裳多带捣茶香。\n云深自是稀来往，婆饼一声清昼长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28455,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次倪梅村见寄韵","author":"蔡槃","text":"江湖不恨知心少，只怕相逢雪上头。\n万事悠悠双弊屣，百年渺渺一虚舟。\n共斟荷露吟终日，坐挹松风喜近秋。\n更好停杯溪上月，不妨为我夜深留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28456,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹 其一","author":"吴惟信","text":"所爱幽窗下，烟丛与露枝。\n才闻风起处，便是雨来时。\n节直将谁比，心空只自知。\n青青长在眼，休说化龙迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28457,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"约友同游","author":"蔡槃","text":"买得扁舟系海滨，梅花岭上浪游人。\n江山若欲留连客，诗酒何妨报答春。\n柳带梳风黄尚浅，草茵铺雨绿将匀。\n约君携手同行乐，趁取东郊景物新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28458,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自叙","author":"蔡槃","text":"江湖閒步几经年，穷似襄阳孟浩然。\n折简为求僧舍茗，典衣因欠酒家钱。\n真情尽向诗中见，归梦常于枕上圆。\n世路风波深可畏，结茅何日遂归田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28459,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过横岭书信臣宅壁","author":"蔡槃","text":"马嘶残月醉醒中，行尽天涯西复东。\n两鬓欲霜难讳老，一心忧国不妨穷。\n只今世路浑如水，从旧交情独有公。\n彭泽门前昔时柳，也应相傍得春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28460,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑介道见访","author":"许棐","text":"步头杨柳种多年，今日方维胜客船。\n扫石共看山色坐，枕书同听雨声眠。\n溪羹旋煮莼丝滑，野饭新炊芡玉圆。\n不管归心忙似箭，强留吟过菊花天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28461,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金陵","author":"蔡槃","text":"六代帝王州，寒烟满石头。\n星河天北转，江汉水东流。\n步绝金莲雨，歌残玉树秋。\n白头有渔父，犹说景阳楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28462,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春思","author":"蔡槃","text":"自觉无春思，春长在眼前。\n天晴梅堕雪，地暖草生烟。\n独步迷山影，空肠饱涧泉。\n乡心徒耿耿，为客又经年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28463,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旅中","author":"蔡槃","text":"梧叶响荒塘，秋宵不耐长。\n猿啼千嶂外，人在一灯旁。\n雁影溪桥月，钟声野寺霜。\n明朝又何处，烟水正茫茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28464,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别","author":"蔡槃","text":"欲去休云易，相思恐弗禁。\n一床秋雨梦，千里暮云心。\n每自悲行役，知谁识老吟。\n西风闻过雁，记取问佳音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28465,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中","author":"蔡槃","text":"绕舍东风急，柴门静掩时。\n交情贫里见，药性病中知。\n沉寂心当定，清羸步懒移。\n呼童理书案，为管旧时书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28466,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古","author":"蔡槃","text":"郁郁东南旺气浮，吴争越战几春秋。\n一阳柳色浑无恙，五月荷花半是愁。\n隆替且容吾辈老，英雄都付此江流。\n中原苦被淮山隔，莫向西风更倚楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28467,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄北涧","author":"蔡槃","text":"拟定书中字，山中欲问谁。\n一从分手后，尽是断肠时。\n烧叶驱残冻，挑蔬备夕饥。\n相思不但此，明月梦魂随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28468,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄友","author":"王安之","text":"忆昔青灯夜对床，冷猿声里早梅香。\n一从去棹冲寒雪，几度凭阑到夕阳。\n秋思渐于蝉外觉，别愁空入雁边长。\n梧桐解得离人意，不遣西风叶尽黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28469,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿碧瑶山房","author":"蔡槃","text":"市声不到处，作屋仅三间。\n洗砚添新水，开窗放远山。\n湿云侵树黑，疏雨蚀苔斑。\n近有閒生活，吟编手自删。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28470,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒范文正公祠","author":"蔡槃","text":"半龛遗像饰貂蝉，往事犹思庆历前。\n未说两朝亲捧日，且言一柱独擎天。\n山林付与书生管，香火当同信史传。\n独恨军中无此老，如今西贼又侵边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28471,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄倪升之","author":"吴惟信","text":"寻常曾见说，家远欲归难。\n身暂投莲社，心犹在杏坛。\n摊书灯下读，磨剑月中看。\n近日无消息，相思雨雪寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28472,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游古寺","author":"蔡槃","text":"山烟寒日暝，鸱殿与云齐。\n松鼠下阶走，竹鸡当户啼。\n碑荒文字古，僧老语音低。\n欲往应无计，斜阳照杖藜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28473,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游梅庵","author":"蔡槃","text":"一点尘难着，推窗晚翠开。\n早知延话久，悔不带诗来。\n医俗可无竹，耐交惟有梅。\n平生爱闲步，踏碎几莓苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28474,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越州早行","author":"蔡槃","text":"青鞋三十里，草露惹衣斑。\n潮落曹娥渡，云荒夏禹山。\n秋声黄叶里，天影白鸥间。\n欲问钱塘路，渔家未启关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28475,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠江湖隐者","author":"蔡槃","text":"湖上人家住最幽，檐牙倒影落沧洲。\n诗成梅坞三更月，酒醒蓬窗午夜秋。\n移石为添烧药灶，卖金因起读书楼。\n经年不入城闉去，长倚阑干看白鸥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28476,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客中","author":"蔡槃","text":"举酒吟诗易，居贫作客难。\n一番思世事，半日倚阑干。\n霜重竹篱薄，风高石径寒。\n无言搔短发，望眼到长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28477,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄何尉","author":"蔡槃","text":"向晚出林麓，思君隔瀼湾。\n因看云过岭，不觉日沉山。\n犬吠疏篱下，牛归古道间。\n一声何处笛，明月上松关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28478,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大港即事次韵 其二","author":"蔡肇","text":"野草追随岸接篱，紫荆门巷日平西。\n自言今岁春耕早，腊雪消来水一犁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28479,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大港即事次韵 其一","author":"蔡肇","text":"村落家家有酒沽，黄童白叟醉相扶。\n恨无韩滉丹青手，更作丰年几幅图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28480,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小诗戏无咎","author":"蔡肇","text":"吴山楚水未忘怀，暮雨朝云恨已乖。\n纵免摩伽能毁戒，未妨泽室会千斋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28481,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从孙元忠乞猫","author":"蔡肇","text":"厨廪空虚鼠亦饥，终宵咬齧近秋帷。\n腐儒生计惟黄卷，乞取衔蝉与护持。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28482,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汎舟横塘遇雨","author":"蔡肇","text":"平野风烟入梦思，殷勤作画更题诗。\n扁舟卧听横塘雨，恰遇江南归雁时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28483,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过邢惇夫墓下作","author":"蔡肇","text":"人物于今叹渺然，孤坟宿草已生烟。\n日暮行人道傍会，应逢年少与谈玄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28484,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和无咎奉答文潜戏赠","author":"蔡肇","text":"邓子词锋鲁孟劳，刜钟剸玉尽铅刀。\n风流陶谢枝梧困，击节期君仆命骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28485,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和慎思与文潜无咎对榻夜话达旦","author":"蔡肇","text":"穷秋天气少晴明，雨叶风窗夜夜声。\n应为幽人听未足，不教骢马出重城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28486,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和慎思寄次张弟","author":"蔡肇","text":"南山千亩龙蛇窟，半夜春雷起屈盘。\n欲钓六鳌沧海去，为留春笋作长竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28487,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中游西庵","author":"蔡肇","text":"夹岸鸣钟早渡回，冥冥江色未全开。\n西庵要看千峰碧，更有江南半月梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28488,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送洞元法师归茅山三首 其三","author":"蔡肇","text":"一庵畴昔共嵚崟，古木垂阴岁月深。\n恐是三生房次律，要随藤杖去重寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28489,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送洞元法师归茅山三首 其二","author":"蔡肇","text":"崇宁新阁连云起，天篆浮空宝气飞。\n帝遣群龙常护守，池潭风雨夜深归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28490,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送洞元法师归茅山三首 其一","author":"蔡肇","text":"绛节飘飘下紫清，更参隐诀制颓龄。\n若逢方丈庞眉叟，来爱囊中赤甲经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28491,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题三茅风雨图","author":"蔡肇","text":"笔间云气生毫末，纸上松声听有无。\n收得三茅风雨样，高堂六月是冰壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28492,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题李世南画扇","author":"蔡肇","text":"野水潺潺平落涧，秋风瑟瑟细吹林。\n逢人抱瓮知村近，隔坞闻钟觉寺深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28493,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题画授李伯时","author":"蔡肇","text":"鸿雁归时水拍天，平冈老木尚依然。\n借君馀地安渔艇，乞我寒江听雨眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28494,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠王子飞之高丽","author":"蔡肇","text":"闻君秉笔赋鸡林，海怪山奇人购寻。\n莫纪大宛多善马，却令天子便甘心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28495,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北固山","author":"蔡肇","text":"一径杉松驻晚烟，渐看台影入云间。\n江拖缟带萦危堞，地注青螺出远山。\n当日英雄无复见，此时箫鼓有谁閒。\n我来应被藤萝笑，尘满衣冠盍厚颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28496,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甘露寺遭火","author":"蔡肇","text":"聚墨魔宫殿，毗岚色界天。\n劫灰迷狠石，铅水泫铜仙。\n扁榜无佳句，华榱有胜缘。\n大江春正碧，白昼岛夷船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28497,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春日焦山留宿","author":"蔡肇","text":"岁为兹山一再登，渡头飞阁独相凭。\n云生江海交流处，人在松萝最上层。\n残雪既能留野客，春风先与报山僧。\n凭谁邀上东岩宿，更约花时命杖藤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28498,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]